  "changelog": "Declare Vibe agent modes to CadencR: the models command now returns the mode selector with _meta.cadencr.permissionMode on each value (auto-approve -> bypassPermissions, smart-approve -> auto, accept-edits -> acceptEdits, ask -> ask), with auto-approve as the primary mode so new conversations start in auto-accept. The permission-mode chip is visible again and Shift+Tab cycles the modes."
